  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Directions/Roadmap for Netherlands&#x2013;India Joint Initiatives on Green Hydrogen Technologies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity involves a market scoping study of India&#x2019;s green hydrogen ecosystem to identify opportunities for Dutch innovation, research and industry. The study will analyse the value chain, including production, storage, transport and downstream applications, and assess how Dutch technological strengths and expertise can connect to emerging market opportunities in India.Building on existing Netherlands-India cooperation on hydrogen innovation, the study will inform future R&amp;D collaboration, pilot projects and trade engagement between both countries. The findings will support strategic positioning of Dutch stakeholders in India&#x2019;s growing hydrogen sector and will be presented at India Energy Week 2026 to promote visibility and follow-up action.</narrative>
  </description>
